w-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>    <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_DrowLeather_A_Shoulderpads</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Stealthier\" title=\"Stealthier\">Stealthier</a></dt><dd>While <a href=\"/wiki/Obscured\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Obscured\">obscured</a>, the wearer gains a +3 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> Checks.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ruined_Battlefield\" title=\"Ruined Battlefield\">Ruined Battlefield</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;33&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;145</span>: In a locked opulent chest in the abandoned house by the river east of the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Appearance in game</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 153.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Penumbral_Armour_in_game_female.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Penumbral_Armour_in_game_female.PNG/230px-Penumbral_Armour_in_game_female.PNG.webp, /w/images/9/9a/Penumbral_Armour_in_game_female.PNG 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Penumbral Armour worn by Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Penumbral_Armour_in_game_female.PNG/230px-Penumbral_Armour_i